transition-transform duration-200 text-center group pr-6\"><span class=\"mx-auto\">Download Resume</span><span></span></a><a href=\"mailto:adhikarisamir68@gmail.com\" class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.09em] px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-foreground text-background hover:translate-y-[-2px] transition-transform duration-200 text-center\">Hire me</a></div><button class=\"md:hidden flex flex-col justify-center gap-[5px] w-8 h-8\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><span class=\"block h-px w-6 bg-[var(--foreground)] origin-center\"></span><span class=\"block h-px w-6 bg-[var(--foreground)]\"></span><span class=\"block h-px w-6 bg-[var(--foreground)] origin-center\"></span></button></div></header><section class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 pt-16 sm:pt-20 pb-12 sm:pb-16 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 sm:mb-4 px-4 py-1.5 border border-foreground/14 rounded-full bg-foreground/5 mt-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px)\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent [animation:pulse_2.2s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase flex items-center gap-2\">Full-Stack Developer<!-- --> <span class=\"w-[2px] h-[2px] rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span> <!-- -->Exploring LLMs</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-end mb-10 sm:mb-12\"><h1 class=\"font-serif font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em] text-[clamp(2.5rem,7vw,6.4rem)] text-foreground\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\">Shaping elegant,<br/><span class=\"italic text-accent\">reliable</span> digital products<br/>with grounded AI depth.</h1><div class=\"flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-2.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 lg:pb-0 px-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 px-[1.4rem] py-[1.1rem] rounded-[14px] border border-foreground/14 min-w-[120px] lg:min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-x-2 bg-foreground/5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-light text-[1.9rem] leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground\">3+ yr</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.07em] text-foreground/60 mt-1\">Frontend journey</p></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 px-[1.4rem] py-[1.1rem] rounded-[14px] border border-foreground/14 min-w-[120px] lg:min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-x-2 bg-foreground/5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-light text-[1.9rem] leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground\">1 yr</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.07em] text-foreground/60 mt-1\">Professional experience</p></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 px-[1.4rem] py-[1.1rem] rounded-[14px] border border-foreground/14 min-w-[120px] lg:min-w-0 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-x-2 bg-foreground/5\"><p class=\"font-serif font-light text-[1.9rem] leading-none tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground\">6 mo</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.07em] text-foreground/60 mt-1\">Backend deep dive</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-6 pt-8 sm:pt-9 border-t border-foreground/14\"><p class=\"font-sans text-[15px] leading-[1.82] text-foreground/60 max-w-[540px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\">Full-stack developer with 3+ years in frontend and 1 year of professional experience. Currently focused on backend systems, Python, LLMs, and web automation.</p><div class=\"flex gap-[0.65rem]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><a href=\"#work\" class=\"font-sans text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em] px-6 sm:px-7 py-[13px] rounded-full bg-foreground text-background hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 transition-all duration-300\">View Work</a><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"font-sans text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em] px-6 sm:px-7 py-[13px] rounded-full border border-foreground/20 text-foreground hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300\">Let&#x27;s Talk</a></div></div></section><div class=\"border-t border-b border-foreground/14 py-3 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex w-max\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Full-Stack Development<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">React.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Next.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Node.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">NestJS<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">FastAPI<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">PostgreSQL<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">LLMs<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Full-Stack Development<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">React.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Next.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">Node.js<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">NestJS<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">FastAPI<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">PostgreSQL<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground/60 flex items-center gap-6 px-6 whitespace-nowrap\">LLMs<span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block shrink-0\"></span></span></div></div><section id=\"about\" class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 py-16 sm:py-[6.5rem]\"><div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-11\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">01</span><div class=\"w-4 h-px bg-dim\"></div><span class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-ink-mid\">About</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.35fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24 items-start\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><h2 class=\"font-serif font-light text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.8vw,3rem)] leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.025em] text-foreground mb-8 sm:mb-10\">Evolving from frontend craft into<!-- --> <em class=\"italic text-accent\">full-stack systems.</em></h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-[0.65rem]\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-foreground/5 rounded-xl\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/50 mb-1.5\">Location</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground\">Pokhara, Nepal</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-foreground/5 rounded-xl\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/50 mb-1.5\">Role</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground\">Full-Stack Developer</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-foreground/5 rounded-xl\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/50 mb-1.5\">Experience</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground\">1 year professional</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-foreground/5 rounded-xl\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[9px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/50 mb-1.5\">Current Focus</p><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-foreground\">Backend systems and AI workflows</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><p class=\"font-sans text-base leading-[1.88] text-foreground/60 mb-[1.4rem]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\">I am a full-stack developer based in Pokhara, Nepal. Over the last 3 years, I have focused on frontend development with React and Next.js, building clean and practical interfaces.</p><p class=\"font-sans text-base leading-[1.88] text-foreground/60 mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\">In the last 6 months, I have been diving deeper into backend systems with Node.js, NestJS, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL while exploring Python, LLMs, and web automation.</p><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-foreground/50 mb-3\">Currently exploring</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs px-[14px] py-[5px] border border-foreground/20 rounded-full text-foreground/60\">Python</span><span class=\"font-sans text-xs px-[14px] py-[5px] border border-foreground/20 rounded-full text-foreground/60\">Docker</span><span class=\"font-sans text-xs px-[14px] py-[5px] border border-foreground/20 rounded-full text-foreground/60\">LLMs</span><span class=\"font-sans text-xs px-[14px] py-[5px] border border-foreground/20 rounded-full text-foreground/60\">Web Automation</span><span class=\"font-sans text-xs px-[14px] py-[5px] border border-foreground/20 rounded-full text-foreground/60\">Backend Systems</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"work\" class=\"bg-foreground/5\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 py-16 sm:py-[6.5rem]\"><div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-11\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">02</span><div class=\"w-4 h-px bg-dim\"></div><span class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-ink-mid\">Work</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-end gap-3 mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><h2 class=\"font-serif font-light text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.5vw,2.8rem)] leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.025em] text-foreground\">Personal projects</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6 mb-16\"><a href=\"https://github.com/samiradh058/Job-Portal-v2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Job Portal\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2FjobPortal.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FjobPortal.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2FjobPortal.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-foreground/40 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"flex items-center font-sans text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em] px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-background text-foreground\">View <span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.35rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">Job Portal</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground/50 shrink-0\">2025</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-foreground/60\">Job Portal is a web app built with React, FastAPI, and Celery with role-based authentication , async task processing, CV parsing, embedding-based candidate&#x27;s score/match, and HMAC signature validation for secure APIs.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[0.4rem]\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">OAuth</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Embedding</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">HMAC Verification</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Async Task Processing</span></div></div></div></a><a href=\"https://github.com/samiradh058/Smart-Farming-Decision-and-Inventory-Management/tree/feature/web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"SmartFarm 360\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2FsmartFarm.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FsmartFarm.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2FsmartFarm.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-foreground/40 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"flex items-center font-sans text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em] px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-background text-foreground\">View <span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.35rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">SmartFarm 360</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground/50 shrink-0\">2024</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-foreground/60\">Smart Farm 360 is a smart farming platform built with Next.js and NestJS featuring crop recommendation based on soil and weather data, fertilizer recommendation, disease prediction, and farm inventory management.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[0.4rem]\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Next.js</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">NestJS</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Genetic Algorithm</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">ML-based Disease Prediction</span></div></div></div></a><a href=\"https://github.com/samiradh058/E-Commerce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"QuickCart\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2FquikCart.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2FquikCart.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2FquikCart.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-foreground/40 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\"><span class=\"flex items-center font-sans text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em] px-5 py-2 rounded-full bg-background text-foreground\">View <span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.35rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">QuickCart</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground/50 shrink-0\">2024</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-foreground/60\">QuickCart is a simple e-commerce platform built with Next.js, Express.js, and MongoDB featuring product management CRUD operations, cart and order management, admin dashboard functionality, Cloudinary image uploads, and Khalti test payment integration.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[0.4rem]\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">MERN Stack</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">E-commerce</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Cloudinary</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Online Payment (Khalti)</span></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-end gap-3 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><h2 class=\"font-serif font-light text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.5vw,2.8rem)] leading-[1.18] tracking-[-0.025em] text-foreground\">Experience</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 mb-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background p-5 sm:p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] sm:text-[1.4rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">WOW Finstack Nepal</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-foreground/60\">Nayabazar, Pokhara</p></div><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-foreground/50 shrink-0\">May 2025<!-- --> - <!-- -->May 2026</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.7] text-foreground/70\">Frontend developer responsible for the commercial banking projects listed below: Internet Banking, Card Management, and Core Banking System.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-end gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Internet Banking\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 \" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fibank.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fibank.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fibank.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.35rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">Internet Banking</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent/40 text-accent bg-accent/5 shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap\">Confidential</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-foreground/60\">End-to-end delivery of a secure online banking platform with money transfers, remittance, top-ups, Rav-kav, and other core features, backed by robust security controls.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[0.4rem]\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">React</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">HMAC verification</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">JWT auth</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Card Mgnt. System\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 \" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fcms.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcms.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fcms.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col gap-3 flex-1\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] sm:text-[1.35rem] font-normal tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground\">Card Mgnt. System</h3><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-accent/40 text-accent bg-accent/5 shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap\">Confidential</span></div><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-foreground/60\">Comprehensive card management system for all card-related activities including assigning cards, changing status, setting fees, setting limits, and more.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-[0.4rem]\"><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Next.js</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Typescript</span><span class=\"font-sans text-[11px] px-[10px] py-[3px] rounded-full border border-foreground/14 text-foreground/60 bg-foreground/5\">Tailwind</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full border border-foreground/14 rounded-[18px] bg-background overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div clas